  "description": "Nahyun had a great time with a man she met by chance while traveling alone in Spain. However, he was a man from a chaebol family. A chaebol like the father who abandoned her mother. So she ran away and thought they would never meet again.\n\n“Did you really think I wouldn’t find you?”\n\nThis man was appointed as the president of the company Nahyeon works for.\n\n“The only thing I don’t know about you is why you’re running away from me.”\n\nA cohabitation that began with a relationship made in Spain, and a fatal office romance.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/61126677), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%98%A4%EB%A7%8C%ED%95%9C-%EC%82%AC%EC%9E%A5%EB%8B%98%EC%9D%98-%EC%B9%98%EB%A3%8C%EB%B2%95/3282)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/152048)",
